---
pagination:
  data: sites.entries
  size: 1
  alias: entry
permalink: "/api/site/{{ entry.slug }}.json"
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{#
  One small JSON document per site, so a widget can look up a single URL
  without downloading the whole report. The full report.json is megabytes; each
  of these is under a kilobyte.

  Keyed by the same slug as the site's page. A consumer needs only the site
  URL: the slug is derived from it with string operations alone, so the embed
  component finds this file without an index to download and without
  crypto.subtle — which means it also works on a page served over plain http.

  Stored history is still keyed by hash under results/, and a slug that
  collides falls back to one, so this filename is presentation and the hash
  remains the identity.
-#}
{{ entry | siteApi | json | safe }}
